bfxEd25519.description:
Ed25519 request signing. Send three headers: BFX-API-KEY (your key_id), BFX-TIMESTAMP (unix seconds; rejected if more than 30s from server time), and BFX-SIGNATURE = base64(Ed25519_sign(privateKey, `${timestamp}
${METHOD}
${requestTarget}
${sha256(body)}`)) where requestTarget is the path including any query string. The server verifies the signature against your registered public key; no shared secret exists.
